<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><tr style="vertical-align: top">
<td style="width: 16.45pt"/><td style="width: 9.95pt">2.&#160;</td><td style="text-align: left">Ratification of the Company&#8217;s Independent Auditors</td></tr></table>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><b>&#160;</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 19.55pt">Stockholders ratified the appointment
of GGF CPA LTD. as the independent auditors of the Company for the fiscal year ended December 31, 2025, in accordance with the voting
results listed below.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

